      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="introduction">
        <tei:p>A zulat (piyyut inserted into the blessing after the Shema) used in the Minhag Polin (Eastern Ashkenaz) rite for Shabbat hGadol, by R. Joseph Bonfils. This poem is a narrative of a debate between Pharaoh and the sons of Amram on whether the people Israel are engaged to God or not.</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
      <j:endConditional target="#osp_66806_introduction"/>
